of like trying to let go,

00:05:28.120 --> 00:05:29.060
And I was like, Man...

00:05:29.060 --> 00:05:31.980
Like there's got to be something
like that can, you know,

00:05:31.980 --> 00:05:35.240
make me feel full and
make me feel whole.

00:05:35.240 --> 00:05:39.940
